# The site is static (web/) plus one Node function (api/).
# Keep the Python tooling out of the deployment. Paths are anchored with a
# leading slash so they match only at the repo root: an unanchored "data/"
# also matched web/data/ and left the site without its data files.
/engine/
/pipeline/
/bench/
/brand/
/data/
/scripts/
/vidyut-data/
*.py
__pycache__/
